# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these models, labels or tools, please cite this repository."
title: "riftsight-vision: open weights, labels and tools for recognizing trading cards in gameplay video"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Yang"
    given-names: "Raymond"
license:
  - Apache-2.0
  - CC-BY-4.0
version: "0.3.0"
abstract: >-
  A card detector, a card recognizer, the embedding bank and accept rule they run with, labels
  on public gameplay video as a manifest, and the tools that train, label and evaluate. Built
  for Riftbound and laid out so that it can be pointed at another card game. This project's own
  work in the code and weights, and our own work in the bank and identity groups, and the
  catalog's selection and arrangement, are licensed under Apache-2.0; the annotations in the
  label manifests under CC BY 4.0. Neither covers the card images or the starting checkpoints'
  terms (PROVENANCE.md). A fan project, not endorsed by Riot Games.
keywords:
  - card recognition
  - object detection
  - image retrieval
  - trading card games
repository-code: "https://github.com/ryangswe/riftsight-vision"
date-released: "2026-10-26"
